<div class="card"><h3>Off the deck = portable 8×13 skid sauna</h3><p>A portable wood-fired sauna on skids, set 4 ft off the deck, styled like the rear shed (gray lap siding, white trim, black windows, single-slope roof). A short boardwalk runs from the deck by the hot tub to its small changing room; the sauna stands 4 ft off the deck, outside the covered deck’s roof, then through a glass door into the hot room, where two people can lie flat on 7 ft benches. The stove is fired from outside at the far / yard end through a non-combustible stove wall, with low and high vents. <a href="#sauna">Plans and details</a>.</p></div></div></section>

